<title>SINGAPORE: Serial System's public offer 14 times subscribed.</title>
<headline>Serial System's public offer 14 times subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronic parts distributor Serial System Pte Ltd said on Monday the public portion of its new share offering had been 14 times subcribed.</p>
<p>The company had offered 37 million shares in its initial public offer, comprising 27.75 million public shares at Singapore $0.58 each and 9.25 million placement shares at S$0.60 each.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
